# (L §2.3 vitem `"replace" bandrow`).  The older `replace b row (…) = …` form is not grammar: LOAD-PARSE.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2027-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source s "s"
band b(n: int): int

version v1
  cite s
